ue '${val}' from env '${option.envVar}' is invalid.`;\n        handleOptionValue(val, invalidValueMessage, 'env');\n      });\n    }\n\n    return this;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Internal implementation shared by .option() and .requiredOption()\n   *\n   * @return {Command} `this` command for chaining","lineStart":670,"lineEnd":729,"totalLines":2790,"truncated":true}},"title":"lib/command.js","time":{"start":1787414276361,"end":1787414276429}},"id":"prt_02a3164da001h53wSHLhH5bFPO","sessionID":"ses_fd5cfe9f4fferhZ7MmJZmtE1XS","messageID":"msg_02a314e1a001hpFTxB4aH1fQn9"}}
